          "text": "Legacy Headers",
          "ink": "black"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`Expires: <HTTP-date>` is the HTTP/1.0 predecessor",
            "`Cache-Control: max-age` wins whenever both are present",
            "`Pragma: no-cache` is a request-side relic",
            "Never send `Pragma` on a response — it does nothing"
          ]
